---
import LocalNav from '../components/LocalNav.astro';
import EventFooter from '../components/EventFooter.astro';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-IN" dir="ltr">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
        <title>Privacy Policy - AAAI Event Hub</title>
        <meta name="Description" content="How the AAAI Event Hub collects, uses and protects your personal information." />
        <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/css/fonts.css" />
        <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/css/ac-localnav.built.css" />
        <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/css/event-pages.css" />
    </head>
    <body>
        <LocalNav current="privacy" />
        <main class="event-main">
            <header class="event-hero">
                <p class="eyebrow">AAAI Event Hub</p>
                <h1>Privacy Policy.</h1>
                <p class="subhead">Your data belongs to you. Here's exactly what we collect, why we collect it, and how you stay in control.</p>
            </header>

            <section class="event-section on-white" aria-label="Privacy policy">
                <div class="event-container prose">
                    <p class="prose-meta">Last updated: 1 January 2026</p>

                    <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Registration details</strong> — name, email address, organisation and pass type when you request or purchase a pass.</li>
                        <li><strong>Accessibility needs</strong> — only what you choose to share so we can support you on site.</li>
                        <li><strong>Usage data</strong> — basic, anonymised analytics about pages visited on this website.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
                    <p>We use your information solely to operate the event: issuing passes and confirmations, sharing schedule updates, accommodating accessibility requests and responding to your enquiries. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

                    <h2>3. Sharing with third parties</h2>
                    <p>We share data only with service providers who help us run the event (for example ticketing and email delivery), each bound by confidentiality obligations, and where required by law.</p>

                    <h2>4. Photography at the event</h2>
                    <p>Sessions may be photographed or recorded for archival and promotional purposes. Attendees who prefer not to appear in official material can opt out at registration or by speaking to any staff member.</p>

                    <h2>5. Data retention</h2>
                    <p>Registration data is retained for up to 24 months after the event for accounting and post-event communication, then deleted. You can request earlier deletion at any time.</p>

                    <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
                    <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data, and withdraw consent for future communications, by emailing <a href="mailto:privacy@aaaihub.org">privacy@aaaihub.org</a>.</p>

                    <h2>7. Security</h2>
                    <p>We apply industry-standard safeguards to protect your data. No method of transmission over the internet is perfectly secure, but we review our practices regularly and minimise what we keep.</p>

                    <h2>8. Contact us</h2>
                    <p>Questions about this policy? Write to <a href="mailto:privacy@aaaihub.org">privacy@aaaihub.org</a>.</p>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>
        <EventFooter />
    </body>
</html>
